{"seq":2,"slug":"versioning-strategy","title":"版本策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/shared-packages/versioning-strategy","wordCount":891,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"版本策略\">版本策略</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Monorepo 版本管理要回答&quot;一次变更应改动哪些包的版本号&quot;，围绕两个模式与一套工作流展开：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Fixed（固定模式）</td>\n<td>所有包共享同一版本号，一起发布</td>\n<td>紧密耦合的包集合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Independent（独立模式）</td>\n<td>每个包独立版本，只发布有变更的包</td>\n<td>松耦合的工具库集合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Changesets</td>\n<td>把&quot;记录变更意图&quot;与&quot;执行版本更新&quot;分离</td>\n<td>Monorepo 版本管理事实标准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Conventional Commits</td>\n<td>标准化提交信息，自动推断版本级别</td>\n<td>与 Changesets 配合</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>核心权衡是<strong>消费方心智负担 vs 版本号膨胀</strong>：紧耦合的包用 Fixed 让消费方只需记住一个版本号，松耦合的包用 Independent 避免无谓的版本升级。Changesets 的关键设计在于将&quot;变更意图&quot;（开发者写的 changeset 文件）与&quot;版本更新&quot;（CI 执行的 <code>changeset version</code>）拆成两步，使版本变更可审查、可自动化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"monorepo-版本管理的特殊性\">Monorepo 版本管理的特殊性</h2><p>在 Polyrepo 中，每个仓库只需管理自己的版本号。但在 Monorepo 中，多个包共存于同一仓库，版本管理面临新的问题：一次 PR 可能同时修改了三个包，这三个包的版本号应该如何变更？关联的包是否需要同步更新版本？这些问题的答案取决于你选择的<strong>版本策略</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    CHANGE[一次代码变更] --&gt; Q{影响了哪些包？}&#10;    Q --&gt; A[&quot;只修改了 @myorg/utils&quot;]&#10;    Q --&gt; B[&quot;同时修改了 utils 和 ui&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; BUMP_ONE[只更新 utils 版本]&#10;    B --&gt; BUMP_MULTI[两个包都需要版本更新]&#10;    BUMP_MULTI --&gt; MODE{版本模式？}&#10;    MODE --&gt; FIXED[Fixed: 所有包同步到相同版本]&#10;    MODE --&gt; INDEPENDENT[Independent: 每个包独立版本]\">flowchart TD\n    CHANGE[一次代码变更] --&gt; Q{影响了哪些包？}\n    Q --&gt; A[\"只修改了 @myorg/utils\"]\n    Q --&gt; B[\"同时修改了 utils 和 ui\"]\n    A --&gt; BUMP_ONE[只更新 utils 版本]\n    B --&gt; BUMP_MULTI[两个包都需要版本更新]\n    BUMP_MULTI --&gt; MODE{版本模式？}\n    MODE --&gt; FIXED[Fixed: 所有包同步到相同版本]\n    MODE --&gt; INDEPENDENT[Independent: 每个包独立版本]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"fixed-模式-vs-independent-模式\">Fixed 模式 vs Independent 模式</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Fixed（固定模式）</th>\n<th>Independent（独立模式）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>版本号</td>\n<td>所有包共享同一版本号</td>\n<td>每个包有独立的版本号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>发布</td>\n<td>所有包一起发布</td>\n<td>只发布有变更的包</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消费方</td>\n<td>简单——只需记住一个版本号</td>\n<td>灵活——按需更新</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>紧密耦合的包集合</td>\n<td>松耦合的工具库集合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型项目</td>\n<td>Babel、Angular</td>\n<td>Lodash 系列、独立工具</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"fixed-模式示例\">Fixed 模式示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2.5.0&quot;,&#10;  &quot;packages&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;@myorg/ui&quot;: &quot;2.5.0&quot;,&#10;    &quot;@myorg/utils&quot;: &quot;2.5.0&quot;,&#10;    &quot;@myorg/types&quot;: &quot;2.5.0&quot;,&#10;    &quot;@myorg/config&quot;: &quot;2.5.0&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2.5.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"packages\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"@myorg/ui\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2.5.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"@myorg/utils\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2.5.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"@myorg/types\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2.5.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"@myorg/config\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2.5.0\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"independent-模式示例\">Independent 模式示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;packages&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;@myorg/ui&quot;: &quot;3.1.0&quot;,&#10;    &quot;@myorg/utils&quot;: &quot;2.8.4&quot;,&#10;    &quot;@myorg/types&quot;: &quot;1.5.2&quot;,&#10;    &quot;@myorg/config&quot;: &quot;1.0.1&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"packages\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"@myorg/ui\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"3.1.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"@myorg/utils\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2.8.4\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"@myorg/types\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1.5.2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"@myorg/config\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1.0.1\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 如果你的包之间经常需要一起使用，Fixed 模式降低了消费方的心智负担。如果包之间相对独立，Independent 模式避免了不必要的版本号膨胀。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"changesets-工作流\">Changesets 工作流</h2><p><strong>Changesets</strong> 是目前 Monorepo 版本管理的事实标准工具。它将&quot;记录变更意图&quot;和&quot;执行版本更新&quot;分离为两个独立步骤：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 安装 Changesets&#10;// pnpm add -D @changesets/cli -w&#10;// pnpm changeset init&#10;&#10;// 步骤 1：开发者在 PR 中记录变更意图&#10;// pnpm changeset\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 安装 Changesets</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// pnpm add -D @changesets/cli -w</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// pnpm changeset init</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 步骤 1：开发者在 PR 中记录变更意图</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// pnpm changeset</span></span></code></pre></div><p>运行 <code>pnpm changeset</code> 会引导你选择受影响的包和变更级别：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"🦋  Which packages would you like to include?&#10;◉ @myorg/ui&#10;◉ @myorg/utils&#10;&#10;🦋  Which packages should have a major bump?&#10;◯ @myorg/ui&#10;◯ @myorg/utils&#10;&#10;🦋  Which packages should have a minor bump?&#10;◉ @myorg/ui&#10;&#10;🦋  Please enter a summary for this change:&#10;◉ Added new DatePicker component with range selection support\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>🦋  Which packages would you like to include?</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>◉ @myorg/ui</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>◉ @myorg/utils</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>🦋  Which packages should have a major bump?</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>◯ @myorg/ui</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>◯ @myorg/utils</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>🦋  Which packages should have a minor bump?</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>◉ @myorg/ui</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>🦋  Please enter a summary for this change:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>◉ Added new DatePicker component with range selection support</span></span></code></pre></div><p>生成的 changeset 文件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"---&#10;&#39;@myorg/ui&#39;: minor&#10;&#39;@myorg/utils&#39;: patch&#10;---&#10;&#10;Added new DatePicker component with range selection support. Updated date formatting utilities.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'@myorg/ui'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">minor</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'@myorg/utils'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">patch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Added new DatePicker component with range selection support. Updated date formatting utilities.</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;$schema&quot;: &quot;https://unpkg.com/@changesets/config@3.0.0/schema.json&quot;,&#10;  &quot;changelog&quot;: &quot;@changesets/cli/changelog&quot;,&#10;  &quot;commit&quot;: false,&#10;  &quot;fixed&quot;: [],&#10;  &quot;linked&quot;: [[&quot;@myorg/ui&quot;, &quot;@myorg/types&quot;]],&#10;  &quot;access&quot;: &quot;restricted&quot;,&#10;  &quot;baseBranch&quot;: &quot;main&quot;,&#10;  &quot;updateInternalDependencies&quot;: &quot;patch&quot;,&#10;  &quot;ignore&quot;: [&quot;@myorg/web&quot;, &quot;@myorg/admin&quot;]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"$schema\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://unpkg.com/@changesets/config@3.0.0/schema.json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"changelog\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@changesets/cli/changelog\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"commit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"fixed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"linked\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@myorg/ui\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@myorg/types\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"access\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"restricted\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"baseBranch\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"main\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"updateInternalDependencies\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"patch\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"ignore\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@myorg/web\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@myorg/admin\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>配置字段</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>fixed</code></td>\n<td>固定版本组，组内包同步版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>linked</code></td>\n<td>链接版本组，组内包的 major/minor 同步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>access</code></td>\n<td>npm 发布权限（public/restricted）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>updateInternalDependencies</code></td>\n<td>内部依赖的自动更新级别</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ignore</code></td>\n<td>不参与版本管理的包（如应用）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"conventional-commits\">Conventional Commits</h2><p><strong>Conventional Commits</strong> 是一种标准化的提交信息格式，可以与 Changesets 配合实现自动化版本推断：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"feat(ui): add DatePicker component&#10;fix(utils): handle timezone offset in formatDate&#10;docs(types): update JSDoc for ApiResponse type&#10;chore(config): bump typescript to 5.7.0&#10;BREAKING CHANGE: DatePicker API changed from single date to date range\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light gi