e=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> config;</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"版本消费流程\">版本消费流程</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant Dev as 开发者&#10;    participant PR as Pull Request&#10;    participant Bot as Changeset Bot&#10;    participant CI as CI/CD&#10;    participant NPM as npm registry&#10;&#10;    Dev-&gt;&gt;PR: 提交代码 + changeset 文件&#10;    Bot-&gt;&gt;PR: 检查是否包含 changeset&#10;    PR-&gt;&gt;CI: 合并到 main&#10;    CI-&gt;&gt;CI: pnpm changeset version&#10;    CI-&gt;&gt;CI: 更新 package.json 版本号&#10;    CI-&gt;&gt;CI: 生成 CHANGELOG.md&#10;    CI-&gt;&gt;CI: pnpm changeset publish&#10;    CI-&gt;&gt;NPM: 发布更新的包\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Dev as 开发者\n    participant PR as Pull Request\n    participant Bot as Changeset Bot\n    participant CI as CI/CD\n    participant NPM as npm registry\n\n    Dev-&gt;&gt;PR: 提交代码 + changeset 文件\n    Bot-&gt;&gt;PR: 检查是否包含 changeset\n    PR-&gt;&gt;CI: 合并到 main\n    CI-&gt;&gt;CI: pnpm changeset version\n    CI-&gt;&gt;CI: 更新 package.json 版本号\n    CI-&gt;&gt;CI: 生成 CHANGELOG.md\n    CI-&gt;&gt;CI: pnpm changeset publish\n    CI-&gt;&gt;NPM: 发布更新的包</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"自动化版本-pr\">自动化版本 PR</h2><p>Changesets 提供了 GitHub Action 来自动化版本更新和发布：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# .github/workflows/release.yml&#10;name: Release&#10;&#10;on:&#10;  push:&#10;    branches: [main]&#10;&#10;jobs:&#10;  release:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v4&#10;      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          node-version: 20&#10;          cache: pnpm&#10;&#10;      - run: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile&#10;&#10;      - name: Create Release PR or Publish&#10;        uses: changesets/action@v1&#10;        with:&#10;          publish: pnpm changeset publish&#10;          version: pnpm changeset version&#10;          commit: &#39;chore: version packages&#39;&#10;          title: &#39;chore: version packages&#39;&#10;        env:&#10;          GITHUB_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}&#10;          NPM_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.NPM_TOKEN }}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .github/workflows/release.yml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Release</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    branches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  release</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm/action-setup@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/setup-node@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          node-version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          cache</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm install --frozen-lockfile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Create Release PR or Publish</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">changesets/action@v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          publish</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm changeset publish</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm changeset version</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          commit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'chore: version packages'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          title</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'chore: version packages'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        env</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          GITHUB_TOKEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          NPM_TOKEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ secrets.NPM_TOKEN }}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((版本策略))&#10;    模式选择&#10;      Fixed 统一版本&#10;      Independent 独立版本&#10;      linked 链接组&#10;    Changesets&#10;      记录变更意图&#10;      自动版本推断&#10;      CHANGELOG 生成&#10;    Conventional Commits&#10;      标准化提交格式&#10;      feat/fix/chore&#10;      commitlint 校验&#10;    自动化&#10;      GitHub Action&#10;      Version PR&#10;      自动发布\">mindmap\n  root((版本策略))\n    模式选择\n      Fixed 统一版本\n      Independent 独立版本\n      linked 链接组\n    Changesets\n      记录变更意图\n      自动版本推断\n      CHANGELOG 生成\n    Conventional Commits\n      标准化提交格式\n      feat/fix/chore\n      commitlint 校验\n    自动化\n      GitHub Action\n      Version PR\n      自动发布</pre><ul>\n<li>Monorepo 版本策略分为 Fixed（统一版本）和 Independent（独立版本），选择取决于包间耦合度</li>\n<li>Changesets 将&quot;记录变更&quot;和&quot;执行版本更新&quot;分离，是 Monorepo 版本管理的事实标准</li>\n<li>Conventional Commits 标准化提交信息格式，支持自动推断版本变更级别</li>\n<li><code>linked</code> 配置让相关包的 major/minor 版本保持同步，适合有紧密关联的包组</li>\n<li>通过 GitHub Action 实现自动化的版本 PR 和 npm 发布，减少人工操作</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"版本策略","id":"版本策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Monorepo 版本管理的特殊性","id":"monorepo-版本管理的特殊性"},{"level":2,"text":"Fixed 模式 vs Independent 模式","id":"fixed-模式-vs-independent-模式"},{"level":3,"text":"Fixed 模式示例","id":"fixed-模式示例"},{"level":3,"text":"Independent 模式示例","id":"independent-模式示例"},{"level":2,"text":"Changesets 工作流","id":"changesets-工作流"},{"level":2,"text":"Conventional Commits","id":"conventional-commits"},{"level":2,"text":"版本消费流程","id":"版本消费流程"},{"level":2,"text":"自动化版本 PR","id":"自动化版本-pr"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"包设计原则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/shared-packages/package-design"},"next":{"title":"类型共享","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/shared-packages/type-sharing"}}